<title>UK: GOLF-LEADING EUROPEAN TOUR MONEY WINNERS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING EUROPEAN TOUR MONEY WINNERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
